<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Big Flower Press.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Big Flower Press.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns said it initiated coverage of Big Flower Press Holdings with an attractive rating, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Big Flower Press was unchanged at 21-1/2.</p>
